    "title": "Suspect fleeing police crashes into driver, both sent to hospital - NewsBreak",
    "text": "openvallejo.org\nwebsite\nVallejo\nSuspect fleeing police crashes into driver, both sent to hospital\nBy Sarah Hopkins,\n6 hours agoA suspect fleeing police in a Range Rover collided with another motorist in a residential neighborhood on June 19, in an incident that sent both drivers to the hospital. “The driver fled at high speed, ignored stop signs, and collided with another moving vehicle” after police attempted a traffic stop, the Vallejo Police Department wrote in a June 22 social media post. The post, which police cited as a reflection of the department’s commitment to community safety, made no mention of injuries.",
